    "diagnosis": "<p>Chondromyxoid fibroma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Radiograph shows an eccentrically localized, expansile mixed osteolytic-sclerotic tumour with a well-defined sclerotic margin in the metaphysis and proximal diaphysis of the tibia. The combination of these morphological characteristics with the location is indicative of chondromyxoid fibroma.</p>",
